<!-- 细线强调式底部导航栏：静默灰 / 点击红色线条 / 活跃墨黑+常驻红线 -->
<view class="tab-bar" hidden="{{hidden}}">
  <view
    wx:for="{{list}}"
    wx:key="index"
    class="tab {{selected === index ? 'tab--active' : ''}}"
    data-index="{{index}}"
    bindtap="switchTab"
    hover-class="tab--press"
    hover-stay-time="80"
  >
    <image class="tab__icon" src="{{selected === index ? item.iconInk : item.iconGray}}" mode="aspectFit" />
    <view class="tab__label">{{item.text}}</view>
  </view>
</view>
